<title>USA: PIP raises tender offer price for Prometheus.</title>
<headline>PIP raises tender offer price for Prometheus.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIP Partners-General LLC said it raised its tender offer price from $450 to $475 per unit for up to 9,000 outstanding units of limited partnership interest in Prometheus Income Partners, a California limited partnership.</p>
<p>PIP General is an affiliate of the general partner of the Partnership. The offer, as increased, will remain open until midnight, December 9.</p>
</text>
